          "rawConfiguration": {
            "text": "## How the rating / health score is computed\\n\\nHealth score (0-100) = `100 x (linters in success + 0.5 x linters with non-blocking errors) / total linters`\\n\\n| Rating | Health score |\\n|---|---|\\n| A | >= 90 |\\n| B | >= 80 |\\n| C | >= 65 |\\n| D | >= 50 |\\n| E | < 50 |\\n\\nTo improve it: fix the linters in error first (full share each), then the warnings (half share each). Use the Repository and Branch variables to focus this page."
          }
